```css
/* Improve the existing filter card styling - add this to your CSS */

/* Style the entire filter card better */
.card.bg-light {
    background: white !important;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

/* Improve the label */
.card.bg-light .form-label.fw-bold {
    background: #f0f7f0;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--primary);
}

/* Improve the dropdown */
.card.bg-light .form-select {
    border-radius: 20px;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background-color: #fff;
    min-width: 200px;
}

.card.bg-light .form-select:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(58, 138, 95, 0.15);
}

/* Improve the toggle buttons */
.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn {
    padding: 6px 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn-outline-secondary {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
}

.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn-outline-secondary.active {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: white;
}

.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn-outline-secondary:hover:not(.active) {
    background-color: rgba(58, 138, 95, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
}

/* Style the rounded corners for the button group */
.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn:first-child {
    border-radius: 20px 0 0 20px;
}

.card.bg-light .btn-group .btn:last-child {
    border-radius: 0 20px 20px 0;
}

/* Improve the status indicator text */
#chartModeIndicator {
    background: #e8f5e9;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #2e7d32;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

#chartModeIndicator i {
    margin-right: 6px;
}

/* Better spacing for the entire filter section */
.card.bg-light .card-body.py-2 {
    padding: 12px 20px !important;
}

/* Make the whole filter row responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .card.bg-light .d-flex.align-items-center {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch !important;
        gap: 12px !important;
    }
    
    .card.bg-light .form-select {
        width: 100% !important;
    }
    
    .btn-group {
        width: 100%;
    }
    
    .btn-group .btn {
        flex: 1;
    }
    
    #chartModeIndicator {
        text-align: center;
        white-space: normal;
    }
}
```

This CSS targets your existing HTML structure (with .card.bg-light, .form-label.fw-bold, .btn-group, etc.) so you don't need to change your HTML at all.

The improvements include:

· Better visual hierarchy with background colors
· Rounded corners on all elements
· Proper spacing between elements
· Hover effects on dropdown and buttons
· Responsive design for mobile
· The status indicator now has a nice pill background

